  era: "8th\u201312th c. CE \xB7 Section 12 \xB7 Early Medieval India \xB7 c. 700 \u2013 1200 CE"
  title: Early medieval trade
  text: Some historians see a decline in coinage and long-distance trade in the early medieval north, while others stress its continuity. Arab merchants were active on the west coast, and South Indian guilds such as the Ainnurruvar traded overseas.
